{"ref":"passive:attractorb","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Attractorb is a passive item in Vampire Survivors. It is unlocked upon finding a Vacuum dropped by a light source."]},{"k":"p","c":["Attractorb gives multiplicative bonuses of varying size to the player's ",{"t":"Magnet","r":"powerup:magnet"}," stat."]},{"k":"p","c":["Attractorb is required for the evolution of ",{"t":"Santa Water","r":"weapon:santa-water"},", ",{"t":"La Borra","r":"weapon:la-borra"},". It is also required for the evolution of ",{"t":"Mirage Robe","r":"weapon:mirage-robe"},", ",{"t":"J'Odore","r":"weapon:j-odore"},", in which Attractorb must also be fully leveled."]},{"k":"p","c":["Attractorb can be found as a stage item in ",{"t":"Dairy Plant","r":"stage:dairy-plant"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", ",{"t":"Tiny Bridge","r":"stage:tiny-bridge"},", ",{"t":"Mt.Moonspell","r":"stage:mt-moonspell"},", and ",{"t":"Abyss Foscari","r":"stage:abyss-foscari"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["MAGNET"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"Magnet","r":"powerup:magnet"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["See table."]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Multiplicative"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+300%"]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[[{"t":"Dairy Plant","r":"stage:dairy-plant"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", ",{"t":"Tiny Bridge","r":"stage:tiny-bridge"},", ",{"t":"Mt.Moonspell","r":"stage:mt-moonspell"},", ",{"t":"Abyss Foscari","r":"stage:abyss-foscari"}]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"levels","title":"Levels","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Attractorb has 5 levels. Unlike other passive items, each level provides a different sized bonus."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Description"],"h":1},{"c":["Effect total"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["\"Character picks up items from further away.\""]},{"c":["1.5x Magnet"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["Pickup range increased by 33%."]},{"c":["1.995x Magnet"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["Pickup range increased by 25%."]},{"c":["2.49375x Magnet"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["4"]},{"c":["Pickup range increased by 20%."]},{"c":["2.9925x Magnet"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5"]},{"c":["Pickup range increased by 33%."]},{"c":["3.980025x Magnet"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"evolutions","title":"Evolutions","blocks":[{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Base weapon"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Passive item"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Evolution"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Santa_Water.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:santa-water"},"\n",{"t":"Santa Water","r":"weapon:santa-water"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Attractorb.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:attractorb"},"\nAttractorb"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-La_Borra.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:la-borra"},"\n",{"t":"La Borra","r":"weapon:la-borra"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Mirage_Robe.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:mirage-robe"},"\n",{"t":"Mirage Robe","r":"weapon:mirage-robe"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Attractorb.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:attractorb"},"\nAttractorb"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-J'Odore.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:j-odore"},"\n",{"t":"J'Odore","r":"weapon:j-odore"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Diver_Mines.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:diver-mines"},"\n",{"t":"Diver Mines","r":"weapon:diver-mines"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Attractorb.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:attractorb"},"\nAttractorb+",{"i":"Sprite-Weapon_Power-Up.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:weapon-power-up"},"\n",{"t":"Weapon Power-Up","r":"passive:weapon-power-up"}]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Atmo-Torpedo.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:atmo-torpedo"},"\n",{"t":"Atmo-Torpedo","r":"weapon:atmo-torpedo"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Dragon_Water_Whip.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:dragon-water-whip"},"\n",{"t":"Dragon Water Whip","r":"weapon:dragon-water-whip"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Attractorb.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:attractorb"},"\nAttractorb"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Hydrostormer_Tip.png","w":30,"h":32,"r":"weapon:hydrostormer-tip"},"\n",{"t":"Hydrostormer Tip","r":"weapon:hydrostormer-tip"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Umbra.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:umbra"},"\n",{"t":"Umbra","r":"weapon:umbra"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Attractorb.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:attractorb"},"\nAttractorb"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Vol_Umbra.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:vol-umbra"},"\n",{"t":"Vol Umbra","r":"weapon:vol-umbra"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Screams_from_the_Void.png","w":28,"h":32,"r":"weapon:screams-from-the-void"},"\n",{"t":"Screams from the Void","r":"weapon:screams-from-the-void"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Attractorb.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:attractorb"},"\nAttractorb"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Siren.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:forbidden-siren"},"\n",{"t":"Forbidden Siren","r":"weapon:forbidden-siren"}]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Attractorb's bonuses to Magnet apply multiplicatively. Each level will increase your Magnet by a percent of the current total, not the original total. This means that the Attractorb gives you more powerful bonuses as you level it up."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Each level up approximate to a round multiplier of 1.5x, 2x, 2.5x, 3x, and 4x respectively."]}]}},{"c":["Attractorb is usually better at increasing experience gain than ",{"t":"Crown","r":"passive:crown"},". While Crown provides small bonuses to the actual value of experience, Attractorb makes experience much easier to collect. Combining the two is the best way to gain experience in the entire game."]},{"c":["Attractorb also increases the pickup range of other items. This is useful for picking up Floor Chicken and other consumables at large distances, as to avoid putting yourself in a dangerous scenario. Treasure Chests must be walked over no matter how much Magnet one has."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 27 October 2021 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["While the Attractorb and the ",{"i":"Sprite-Vacuum.png","w":24,"h":24}," Vacuum look very similar, one notable difference between the looks of the two is the fact that the Attractorb has one ring while the Vacuum has two."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}